{"unit_id":"aberter0x3f__dsh-custom-enter-key#card-zh","repo":"aberter0x3f/dsh-custom-enter-key","commit":"c6554d64c586c5f79d86076afd84bdb2b60532f6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-custom-enter-key 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的输入栏插件，可分别设置 Enter、Ctrl/Cmd+Enter 和 Shift+Enter 的行为。它在通用设置中提供提交按键选项，并在文档捕获阶段处理输入栏按键。每个按键都可选择原生换行、排队发送或插话发送；插话在会话空闲或目标为子 agent 时降级为排队，空草稿插话还可将待发送队列送入当前轮次。适合希望按个人习惯调整 DSH 消息提交方式的网页用户。配置保存在浏览器 localStorage，不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/apply.ts:50-73","src/client/keys.ts:79-152","src/client/config.ts:54-89"]}
{"unit_id":"aberter0x3f__dsh-custom-enter-key#card-en","repo":"aberter0x3f/dsh-custom-enter-key","commit":"c6554d64c586c5f79d86076afd84bdb2b60532f6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-custom-enter-key customizes Enter, Ctrl/Cmd+Enter, and Shift+Enter in the DSH web composer. Set each key to newline, queue, or interject in General Settings. Interject falls back to queue when idle. Settings stay in browser localStorage; no API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/apply.ts:50-73","src/client/keys.ts:79-152","src/client/config.ts:54-89"]}
