{"unit_id":"aberter0x3f__dsh-custom-enter-key#feature-1","repo":"aberter0x3f/dsh-custom-enter-key","commit":"c6554d64c586c5f79d86076afd84bdb2b60532f6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-custom-enter-key 的功能「每键独立设置」：在通用设置的「提交按键」区域，为 Enter、Ctrl/Cmd+Enter、Shift+Enter 分别选择换行、排队发送或插话发送；选择立即更新共享配置并保存到浏览器。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/SubmitKeysRow.tsx:153-201","src/client/store.ts:41-51"]}
{"unit_id":"aberter0x3f__dsh-custom-enter-key#feature-2","repo":"aberter0x3f/dsh-custom-enter-key","commit":"c6554d64c586c5f79d86076afd84bdb2b60532f6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-custom-enter-key 的功能「按键映射提交」：在活动输入栏按配置按键时，插件拦截提交手势并调用 DSH 输入 facade；换行保留浏览器原生行为，排队和插话走现有提交流程。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/keys.ts:79-112","src/client/keys.ts:122-152"]}
