{"unit_id":"aberter0x3f__dsh-custom-enter-key#feature-4","repo":"aberter0x3f/dsh-custom-enter-key","commit":"c6554d64c586c5f79d86076afd84bdb2b60532f6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-custom-enter-key 的功能「配置持久化与恢复」：插件把三个按键行为写入浏览器 localStorage；首次使用、数据损坏或存储不可用时使用默认行为，并让当前内存配置继续生效。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/config.ts:54-89"]}
